:"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#pullrequestreview-2623037945","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#pullrequestreview-2623037945"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741"}},"submitted_at":"2025-02-18T10:06:43Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2626701241,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6ckEe5","user":{"login":"OhiraKyou","id":7255919,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTU5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7255919?u=41b29e7196ed835e783ed111bafe20d8c89d4799&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou","html_url":"https://github.com/OhiraKyou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I set up a dev environment and tested the changes locally. I found that only two of the changes (plus a function signature header update) needed to be included to fix the MRP. So, my reversion suggestions are based on the assumption that this would be merged as a fix for the jitter, with any additional work being pushed to an optional future PR.\r\n\r\nMinimum necessary changes:\r\n\r\n- In `Window::_update_viewport_size`, `final_size_override` must be a `Size2`\r\n\t- This is because it is divided by the `content_scale_factor` on lines [1155](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6e4610640ec42271a87a27baeef7625cd3d3ad25/scene/main/window.cpp#L1155) and [1236](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6e4610640ec42271a87a27baeef7625cd3d3ad25/scene/main/window.cpp#L1236), resulting in float values that need to be preserved.\r\n- In `Viewport::_set_size`, `p_size_2d_override` must be a `Size2` (with the redundant `Size2` conversion removed).\r\n\t- This is because `Window` passes in `final_size_override` on [line 1257](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6e4610640ec42271a87a27baeef7625cd3d3ad25/scene/main/window.cpp#L1257).\r\n\r\nIn other words, the math on `Window`'s `final_size_override` is what results in float values. Everywhere else, 2D size overrides are only given integer values. So, changing them to floats doesn't do anything without additional work.\r\n\r\nEdit: Actually, as discussed later, because `p_size_2d_override` is saved to the `Viewport`'s `size_2d_override` in `Viewport::_set_size`, the value will be out of sync with the calculated `stretch_transform` if `size_2d_override` is not also a `Size2`.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#pullrequestreview-2626701241","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#pullrequestreview-2626701241"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741"}},"submitted_at":"2025-02-19T13:37:59Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2632612694,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6c6ntW","user":{"login":"KerekesDavid","id":9087461,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwODc0NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9087461?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid","html_url":"https://github.com/KerekesDavid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#pullrequestreview-2632612694","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102741#pullrequestreview-2632612694"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102741"}},"submitted_at":"2025-02-21T10:18:09Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2632613569,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6c6n7B","user":{"login":"KerekesDavid","id":9087461,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwODc0NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9087461?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid","html_url":"https://github.com/KerekesDavid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/followers","following_url":"http